{"id":"n76162-1-8","stage":5,"title":"진풍경 · 奇观","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76162-1-8-1","ko":"기상 악화로 비행 일정이 갑자기 취소되는 바람에 공항이 북새통이라면서요?","zh":"听说因为天气恶化，航班计划突然取消，机场里一片混乱，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기상","meaning":"气象","explanation":"기상：气象","readings":[{"term":"기상","audio":"/audio/a1613d9acf7083440e4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38287","senseId":"1","lemma":"기상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기상","audio":"/audio/a1613d9acf7083440e4a.mp3"}},{"text":"악화로","meaning":"恶化","explanation":"악화：恶化；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"악화","audio":"/audio/80c92533f85f0c73a33f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66554","senseId":"1","lemma":"악화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"악화로","audio":"/audio/c28c280e780a7383fd95.mp3"}},{"text":"비행","meaning":"飞行","explanation":"비행：飞行","readings":[{"term":"비행","audio":"/audio/33033abb1d1e2d26f550.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15738","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비행","audio":"/audio/33033abb1d1e2d26f550.mp3"}},{"text":"일정이","meaning":"日程，行程","explanation":"일정：日程，行程；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일정","audio":"/audio/510d062ea38e7953e887.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71698","senseId":"1","lemma":"일정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일정이","audio":"/audio/ba10e2b4e44071eff1cd.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"취소되는","meaning":"被取消，被解除","explanation":"취소되다：被取消，被解除；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"취소되다","audio":"/audio/656f057443f5a13cc283.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78909","senseId":"1","lemma":"취소되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"취소되는","audio":"/audio/ab165a89cefeced9fcb1.mp3"}},{"text":"바람에","meaning":"表示后句的理由或原因。","explanation":"바람：表示后句的理由或原因。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58172","senseId":"1","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바람에","audio":"/audio/2c70d627030132bf596e.mp3"}},{"text":"공항이","meaning":"机场","explanation":"공항：机场；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공항","audio":"/audio/fce088cae0e9817824e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25620","senseId":"1","lemma":"공항","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공항이","audio":"/audio/24c75f5ff6605f42750f.mp3"}},{"text":"북새통이라면서요?","meaning":"繁华，纷扰，喧闹，喧哗","explanation":"북새통：繁华，纷扰，喧闹，喧哗；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라면서요：引用名词判断或转述，再向对方确认。","readings":[{"term":"북새통","audio":"/audio/d9646578af50948f2b96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59328","senseId":"1","lemma":"북새통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"북새통이라면서요","audio":"/audio/eaaf704a9196df589a8d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a1613d9acf708344","term":"기상","zh":"气象","audio":"/audio/a1613d9acf7083440e4a.mp3","entryId":"38287","definition":"风、雨、云、雪等在大气里发生的现象。","pronunciation":["기상"]},{"id":"80c92533f85f0c73","term":"악화","zh":"恶化","audio":"/audio/80c92533f85f0c73a33f.mp3","entryId":"66554","definition":"事情或状况向不好的方向发展。","pronunciation":["아콰"]},{"id":"33033abb1d1e2d26","term":"비행","zh":"飞行","audio":"/audio/33033abb1d1e2d26f550.mp3","entryId":"15738","definition":"飞向天空或在空中飞动。","pronunciation":["비행"]},{"id":"510d062ea38e7953","term":"일정","zh":"日程，行程","audio":"/audio/510d062ea38e7953e887.mp3","entryId":"71698","definition":"一定时间内需要做的事；或指为做那样的事而制定的计划。","pronunciation":["일쩡"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"656f057443f5a13c","term":"취소되다","zh":"被取消，被解除","audio":"/audio/656f057443f5a13cc283.mp3","entryId":"78909","definition":"已发表、承诺或预定好的事情被撤销掉。","pronunciation":["취ː소되다","취ː소뒈다"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"表示后句的理由或原因。","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"58172","definition":"表示后句的理由或原因。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"fce088cae0e98178","term":"공항","zh":"机场","audio":"/audio/fce088cae0e9817824e0.mp3","entryId":"25620","definition":"供飞机起飞和降落而设的场地。","pronunciation":["공항"]},{"id":"d9646578af50948f","term":"북새통","zh":"繁华，纷扰，喧闹，喧哗","audio":"/audio/d9646578af50948f2b96.mp3","entryId":"59328","definition":"很多人聚集在一处时喧嚷沸腾的景象。","pronunciation":["북쌔통"]}],"audio":"/audio/74029e0867703f7dc1b1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76162-1-8-2","ko":"네. 공항 곳곳에는 정상 운항을 기다리는 관광객들로 진풍경이 벌어졌습니다.","zh":"是的。机场各处都是等待航班正常起降的游客，场面十分热闹。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"공항","meaning":"机场","explanation":"공항：机场","readings":[{"term":"공항","audio":"/audio/fce088cae0e9817824e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25620","senseId":"1","lemma":"공항","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공항","audio":"/audio/fce088cae0e9817824e0.mp3"}},{"text":"곳곳에는","meaning":"到处，各地，处处，各处","explanation":"곳곳：到处，各地，处处，各处；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"곳곳","audio":"/audio/a6cae037c9233c8a18e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18669","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳곳에는","audio":"/audio/4dca22215d63c0c65f8e.mp3"}},{"text":"정상","meaning":"正常","explanation":"정상：正常","readings":[{"term":"정상","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31752","senseId":"1","lemma":"정상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정상","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3"}},{"text":"운항을","meaning":"航行，运行","explanation":"운항：航行，运行；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운항","audio":"/audio/b63a77fcdfbef7a594ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69318","senseId":"1","lemma":"운항","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운항을","audio":"/audio/8845a0054153b7e131c6.mp3"}},{"text":"기다리는","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리는","audio":"/audio/f472fe56e9a0a1a2c62e.mp3"}},{"text":"관광객들로","meaning":"游客，游人，观光客","explanation":"관광객：游客，游人，观光客；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"관광객","audio":"/audio/59dd0bd7778bf8332e3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22426","senseId":"1","lemma":"관광객","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관광객들로","audio":"/audio/61c94a24294d3e92b5b4.mp3"}},{"text":"진풍경이","meaning":"奇观，风景线","explanation":"진풍경：奇观，风景线；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"진풍경","audio":"/audio/fdeec38977293a47ac70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76162","senseId":"1","lemma":"진풍경","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진풍경이","audio":"/audio/908e12f8f2642989ea51.mp3"}},{"text":"벌어졌습니다.","meaning":"展现，出现","explanation":"벌어지다：展现，出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"벌어지다","audio":"/audio/b6aba93582fa799f6e42.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62090","senseId":"3","lemma":"벌어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌어졌습니다","audio":"/audio/2e8442da6651e875b567.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"fce088cae0e98178","term":"공항","zh":"机场","audio":"/audio/fce088cae0e9817824e0.mp3","entryId":"25620","definition":"供飞机起飞和降落而设的场地。","pronunciation":["공항"]},{"id":"a6cae037c9233c8a","term":"곳곳","zh":"到处，各地，处处，各处","audio":"/audio/a6cae037c9233c8a18e3.mp3","entryId":"18669","definition":"好几个地方；或指各个地方。","pronunciation":["곧꼳"]},{"id":"35688a85f0be1c63","term":"정상","zh":"正常","audio":"/audio/35688a85f0be1c636cd8.mp3","entryId":"31752","definition":"没有特别变化的或没有问题的正规状态。","pronunciation":["정ː상"]},{"id":"b63a77fcdfbef7a5","term":"운항","zh":"航行，运行","audio":"/audio/b63a77fcdfbef7a594ea.mp3","entryId":"69318","definition":"船或飞机来回于规定好的路线或目的地。","pronunciation":["운ː항"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"59dd0bd7778bf833","term":"관광객","zh":"游客，游人，观光客","audio":"/audio/59dd0bd7778bf8332e3e.mp3","entryId":"22426","definition":"去旅游的人。","pronunciation":["관광객"]},{"id":"fdeec38977293a47","term":"진풍경","zh":"奇观，风景线","audio":"/audio/fdeec38977293a47ac70.mp3","entryId":"76162","definition":"有看头的稀奇场面或样子。","pronunciation":["진풍경"]},{"id":"b6aba93582fa799f","term":"벌어지다","zh":"展现，出现","audio":"/audio/b6aba93582fa799f6e42.mp3","entryId":"62090","definition":"某事发生的状况或情形在眼前展开。","pronunciation":["버ː러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7b8c291d1e0c5e83551.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":5.527,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76162","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":177,"sequenceScore":5.3537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的。机场各处都是等待航班正常起降的游客，场面十分热闹。","听说因为天气恶化，航班计划突然取消，机场里一片混乱，对吧？","听说在挖掘遗址时发现了遗骨对吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说因为天气恶化，航班计划突然取消，机场里一片混乱，对吧？","听说在挖掘遗址时发现了遗骨对吧？","是的。机场各处都是等待航班正常起降的游客，场面十分热闹。"],"answer":2}]}
